SY_TALK("3vrYSazpnfQ",[[12,["Yogi intro:"]],[16,["...which has been programmed and set up,","and at that moment it becomes plugged"]],[20,["into the mains, and it becomes connected."]],[23,["That's the moment of actualisation."]],[27,["That's the moment when you become","your Spirit."]],[30,["This is what we've been seeking."]],[34,["There's no mesmerism,","no intellectual dissertations."]],[42,["It's a reality, and it's happening."]],[44,["It's happening on a mass scale."]],[46,["This is the first time Mataji has been","to America since 1972."]],[52,["She came on a visit at that time."]],[54,["But all over the world, Sahaja Yoga,","as it's called, is taking root."]],[59,["Thousands upon thousands of people","are getting their realisation."]],[63,["And when they get it, they're developing","it and settling into it."]],[67,["Their life is being transformed."]],[69,["Physical and emotional problems","just fall away."]],[73,["You start to feel the joy of life."]],[75,["You can cope with the tensions","and stresses of living."]],[79,["And you look at the whole","of human existence"]],[82,["as almost like a bit of a joke."]],[85,["You cope with the problems","in a very wonderful way."]],[93,["The other beautiful thing","about Self-realisation"]],[95,["is that as you get it,","you can give it to others."]],[101,["One light is enlightened,","it can enlighten another light."]],[105,["And this is the way it has to be."]],[106,["It's nothing exclusive.","It's nothing that money can buy."]],[111,["And now, as Mother often says,","on the tree of life"]],[115,["at first there were very, very few","flowers that turned to fruit."]],[119,["Now all the flowers have come,","the blossom time has come."]],[124,["And many, many of those flowers","have to turn to fruit."]],[130,["This is the right of the seekers."]],[133,["This is the right which you've earned","and which you must pursue."]],[141,["Mother has nothing to gain from this."]],[144,["She travels around the world."]],[145,["She is a mother, she is a grandmother,","she is the wife of an important"]],[155,["Secretary General","of the United Nations."]],[157,["So she has no basis for needing","any support of any kind from us."]],[163,["She only gives."]],[165,["And in giving, she is giving nothing","but love and compassion."]],[169,["And that's the power of Divine Love."]],[171,["That's the power of a great spiritual","being to awaken that which is within us"]],[177,["and which is our right."]],[180,["So during this lecture","simply slip your shoes off"]],[183,["and hold your hands out in this fashion","so that you can actually become"]],[189,["earthed to the earth.","That's the purpose."]],[193,["It's as simple as that."]],[198,["It's a very, very basic","electrical circuitry."]],[205,["And just simply hold the hands out","in that fashion"]],[208,["as if asking for something,","as if asking for something."]],[212,["It's as simple as that."]],[213,["And what you perhaps begin to find","is that during the talk"]],[218,["you'll start to feel the vibrations."]],[220,["These vibrations are the vibrations","which have been spoken of"]],[223,["in all the scriptures."]],[225,["If you're a Christian it speaks","of the cool wind of the Holy Spirit."]],[229,["If you're a Muslim it's the Ruh.","And so it goes on."]],[234,["So again I'll introduce to you","our mother, Mataji Nirmala Devi."]],[241,["Shri Mataji: It’s really unbelievable isn’t it?","It sounds so fantastic."]],[245,["I have been here about nine years back","and I told them that, \"It’s within you,"]],[253,["there’s a simplest thing,","is a living process;"]],[256,["it works out, for nothing at all.","It’s your own.\""]],[261,["But what I found, that Americans","were still busy guru shopping;"]],[265,["they wanted to go through that,","they wanted to do all that."]],[269,["What could I do?"]],[270,["I told them, \"You don’t have to do","all this."]],[272,["Why do you want to waste your energy?","Why do you want to waste your money?"]],[275,["Nothing, you just have it!\"","But they wouldn’t."]],[278,["They wanted to spend their money –","they had the money that time,"]],[281,["they thought they can buy some bhagwans","and gods and things like that."]],[288,["All sorts of things were on when I came","here, and they wouldn’t listen to me."]],[292,["They wouldn’t listen to me."]],[294,["I said, \"You cannot purchase it,","you cannot buy it."]],[297,["They are misleading you.\""]],[300,["So I thought, better to retire","for some time from America."]],[306,["But in India now, in the villages,","we have thousands of people"]],[309,["who have got realization – it’s so simple."]],[312,["You are seekers, you are seekers","because the time has come"]],[316,["that you have to be here","and that you have to get your realization."]],[319,["It’s very simple."]],[321,["After all, God has created","this great world;"]],[324,["this creation is His own","and He has to save it."]],[327,["Jolly well, He has to do it."]],[332,["But it is so incredible,","they can’t believe it, it’s impossible."]],[336,["They think, \"How can that be?","We must stand on our heads,\""]],[339,["or, \"We have to pay a lot of money,","we have to become broke,"]],[342,["we have to give up this, give up that.","Do all sorts of nonsensical things"]],[346,["and then, what we find?","We are left high and dry.\""]],[351,["It’s true, I know, it’s true."]],[353,["But you could have avoided it;","when I came here,"]],[357,["I told people very,","very clearly and plainly."]],[362,["But I was amazed, also,","apart from this:"]],[364,["they did all kinds of funny things","about what I announced to them."]],[369,["I said that you are to be born again."]],[371,["Alright, they taped me","and they started organizations"]],[376,["with this name that,","\"We are born again\" –"]],[380,["they certified themselves","and they started another organization"]],[385,["with some vibrations,","something [UNCLEAR Sun]"]],[388,["instead of being honest to yourself","and getting the thing down to Earth."]],[394,["I didn’t know why they were getting","into these hallucinations"]],[397,["which is imaginary things.","We have to be just honest to ourselves. That's all."]],[402,["It's so simple. It’s extremely simple."]],[406,["But when you go to these places","and do that,"]],[409,["you get damaged, you really get damaged."]],[412,["Of course the task is very difficult now for me,","I find, comparatively."]],[418,["It would have been much better","[UNCLEAR] no doubt."]],[422,["But they won’t listen to me,","even up to the point"]],[426,["that they said, \"You must charge","some money."]],[429,["People are doing it for so much,","so much."]],[431,["At least charge some money or then","people will have no value for it.\""]],[434,["I said, \"If they start valuing it","in money, they’ll never value it.\""]],[438,["It should not be done;","whatever is wrong should not be done."]],[442,["And they just wouldn’t accept it;","it’s such a funny situation."]],[446,["That’s how I went back;","nine years I waited."]],[452,["But Americans are great seekers,","they are, despite all these damages."]],[460,["We had a very good experience","the other day,"]],[462,["with all these people who were there."]],[466,["Especially, we went to Boston where","there were about fifty-four people or so,"]],[471,["and fifty of them got realization,","just like that."]],[474,["Fifty of them, can you believe it?","I was amazed. It’s expanding."]],[480,["Consolidation may be a problem,","but that should be consolidated."]],[484,["I did give realization to some here,","and they were quite funny."]],[491,["They started charging people","for their vibrations."]],[494,["Just imagine?","They got it without any payment"]],[498,["or anything, but they started","charging people for it,"]],[501,["and when they came to India, we found","out they had lost their vibrations."]],[504,["They were very heated-up people","and we told them,"]],[506,["\"You cannot charge for it.","How do you charge?\""]],[509,["He said, \"How are we to live?\""]],[510,["I said, \"How did you live before?","Live like that.\""]],[515,["\"Oh, we were schoolteachers, we were…\""]],[517,["I said, \"Do that. You cannot charge","for these vibrations;"]],[521,["these are Divine, this is love,","you cannot charge."]],[523,["How can you sell that?","Can you sell your love?\""]],[528,["It’s a simple thing Americans","have to understand,"]],[531,["that you cannot sell it."]],[533,["It’s too simple for them to understand,","that there could be someone who really"]],[538,["loves, just loves for love’s sake."]],[541,["There could be one, at least,","like that in this whole world."]],[544,["If they understand this,","then it will be easy for them"]],[547,["to understand that all these things","are built-in you;"]],[551,["they are already made like that.","It’s not at all difficult."]],[554,["Like a candle which is made properly","and there’s a wick;"]],[558,["it’s very easy to enlighten that","if you are enlightened."]],[563,["What do you do?","What goes out of this candle?"]],[566,["It’s nothing. You just enlighten","another light without any difficulties."]],[572,["It’s nothing special, nothing great;","it’s very, very simple."]],[577,["But we want to make everything","complicated, and what am I to do?"]],[580,["If you have to eat your food,","you eat like this, isn’t it?"]],[583,["Do you put your hand down like that?"]],[585,["If you have to breathe,","which is so vital; it is the simplest."]],[589,["Do you go to libraries","to read how to breathe?"]],[592,["It’s all so simple, you won’t believe."]],[595,["Like sprouting a seed,","it’s a living process;"]],[597,["it has to be simple, spontaneous.","How can it be complicated?"]],[604,["Then, another problem is that here,","people read a lot about God."]],[609,["You can’t read about Him,","you have to know it."]],[612,["They just read, \"This is the God,","that is the God.\""]],[616,["Today we met somebody who said that,","\"I believe in a man"]],[620,["who calls himself Jesus.\""]],[622,["I said, \"Very good, put him on the water.","Can he walk on the water?"]],[625,["If he can walk on the water,","alright, he’s Jesus."]],[627,["But does he walk?","Put him on the water.\""]],[630,["It’s very simple. If I say I am something,","I must do it, isn’t it?"]],[634,["If somebody says, \"I can make you fly,\"","you start paying him money;"]],[638,["such a lot of money goes to this fellow.","Does he fly?"]],[643,["If he flies, then he can teach you."]],[644,["If he does not know himself how to fly,","how will he teach you?"]],[647,["It’s a very logical thing:","you have to know that"]],[651,["we are not going to fly anymore now.","We have flown as birds,"]],[655,["so we are not going to fly or hop –","we have been that."]],[659,["We are going to become something more","in our awareness."]],[664,["We see the simple thing we should know","that we have to become that."]],[669,["Something in our own awareness,","something has to happen"]],[674,["that should make us something that we are,","that we should become the Absolute."]],[687,["We are not what we are,","we are something else –"]],[690,["we are like our, say, mind,","we are our rationality which can go anywhere."]],[697,["It’s not Absolute."]],[698,["Supposing somebody comes here,","a Mr. XYZ and says,"]],[700,["\"This is a very nice car.\"","Another one will come and say,"]],[703,["\"Oh, it’s not so good.\" Another one say,","\"Maybe good, maybe.\""]],[708,["Three human beings, all of them","are human beings."]],[711,["They are not animals,","they are human beings"]],[714,["from the same place,","from the same village, you can take it."]],[717,["Put them together,","they will have three opinions."]],[722,["If they continue to have criteria,","we shall say –"]],[725,["see they can have even thousand,","if they change. So why?"]],[730,["Because they have not got","their absolute values."]],[734,["there must be something absolute","within us, when you start [INAUDIBLE],"]],[739,["you start feeling the absolute."]],[742,["As he said, really it happens to you."]],[745,["You become that in no time,","and you can feel it –"]],[749,["on your hands, on your fingers –","the reality."]],[754,["You ask a simple question,","\"Is there God?\""]],[756,["Somebody told me,","\"I don’t believe in Christ.\""]],[760,["I said, \"Alright, why? Have you seen Him?","Why don’t you believe?\""]],[763,["\"I don’t believe.\""]],[765,["\"But why? What is the reason?\""]],[767,["\"I believe in this","and I don’t believe in that.\""]],[769,["\"Well, why? Is there any absolute","by which you have judged"]],[774,["whether there was Christ or not?","Whether it was true or not?"]],[777,["Whether it’s just a myth?\""]],[781,["\"No, I have not.\""]],[782,["\"Then how can you say ‘I believe’?’","You keep yourself open!\""]],[787,["First, you become your Self –","that’s like Buddha."]],[791,["He said, \"Don’t talk of God or anything.","First of all, let them become the Self."]],[797,["If they become the Self,","then talk of other things."]],[799,["Because if they do not, if you talk","of something else,"]],[801,["they will come out with their own ideas,","that, ‘I don’t believe in God,"]],[806,["I don’t believe in this,","I don’t believe in that.’ \""]],[808,["So He said, \"Alright,","you become your Self,"]],[811,["that’s the first thing.","Once you become your Self,"]],[814,["then you will start seeing other things","through your awareness,"]],[817,["which is something special.\""]],[819,["And that’s what should happen to you;","is to first become your Self."]],[824,["Then you start judging other things","because now you have that awareness"]],[829,["by which you can judge."]],[832,["How are we to know that –","supposing these vibrations come to us –"]],[836,["whether they are absolute our not?"]],[839,["After all, we should find out","whether they are absolute or not."]],[843,["For that, we can use a method","which is I call as a relative method."]],[848,["Today I told them that you get two boys","who are from a lunatic asylum –"]],[853,["certified mad people."]],[858,["Then get two people","who have got cancer,"]],[862,["and then get two people, one realized","soul and one un-realized soul –"]],[866,["according to me, one is realized,","and one is un-realized."]],[870,["Now you put all of them to me","and ask them to see their vibrations."]],[874,["You will find the person who is mad –","he will start doing all kinds of actions;"]],[883,["he may feel shaking all over the body;","his whole body might shake like this;"]],[889,["the whole thing might [UNCLEAR]."]],[891,["The person with the cancer","will feel terrible heat"]],[893,["getting out of his body, a heat so much","so, it happens sometimes,"]],[898,["that the room does not need a heater –","in London, even during wintertime."]],[903,["Now, you have another one","who is not a realized soul."]],[906,["Such a person may a little bit feel hot,","or something,"]],[910,["and after some time he starts feeling","the cool breeze, gradually,"]],[913,["for a little bit."]],[914,["Then you have a realized soul","and a little child sitting."]],[916,["He said, \"I was [UNCLEAR taking] it","when I entered here."]],[918,["Yes it is there, I know it is there.\""]],[922,["It’s so simple because it is vital.","It’s important;"]],[926,["evolution is the most important thing."]],[930,["That’s how we have become human beings","and you have to become something higher."]],[935,["It’s all placed within us very nicely,","very safe, very protected."]],[940,["But, of course, we go headlong","into every sort of thing"]],[943,["and naturally we get damaged."]],[946,["With all these beautiful things","within us,"]],[948,["I see people doing all kinds","of nonsensical things,"]],[951,["going into all kinds of extremes;","there’s no need to be in extremes."]],[964,["Somebody comes and tells them,","\"You stand on your head,"]],[964,["you’ll get to God.\"","They’ll go on doing it."]],[964,["I mean, use your logic, use your brain.","How can you get to God"]],[966,["by standing on your head?"]],[967,["If it is a living process,","if it’s absolutely living,"]],[974,["then you cannot do anything about it,","because human beings cannot do"]],[979,["anything that is living."]],[983,["At this time, I had told these people","who got their realization last time"]],[988,["that I will tell them about the Kundalini","and the centres and about what they mean."]],[996,["In any case, we have got now books","for you also,"]],[1000,["to go through them and see what it is,","and you can read them"]],[1004,["and you can find out about it.","But in any case, I will tell you little bit."]],[1010,["Here is the chart. This is the Kundalini","here in the triangular bone"]],[1020,["called as sacrum."]],[1060,["This is not important to know,","but I am just telling you,"]],[1063,["because you’ll have curiosity later on,","\"Where is this Kundalini?\""]],[1067,["This Kundalini is placed","in the triangular bone here,"]],[1070,["called as sacrum.","Now sacrum means sacred;"]],[1073,["so the people knew about this,","that it is a sacred bone."]],[1076,["This bone is placed very securely","at the base of the spinal cord."]],[1084,["This is kept there as a residual force,","but it is the energy of your desire"]],[1094,["of becoming one with the Divine.","It is not yet manifested."]],[1099,["That’s why it is called","as a sleeping Kundalini;"]],[1103,["it means that power","has not yet manifested."]],[1107,["On the left-hand side this power","that is within us is the power of desire."]],[1116,["On the right-hand side,","there’s another power"]],[1119,["which is the power of our action."]],[1123,["[The left side] is the one that gives us","our emotional life, our emotional side."]],[1127,["This gives rise to the left","sympathetic nervous system"]],[1130,["and is also looking after the psyche,","which the psychologists talk about."]],[1135,["But most of them are half-baked,","so they just know about this part"]],[1141,["of the Kundalini,","which they call as the ‘psyche.’"]],[1143,["They know very little and when they","try to do anything about it,"]],[1147,["they are so unauthorized that they","create problems for others"]],[1150,["and create problems for themselves."]],[1152,["They have no idea as to what we are,","and they just try to meddle"]],[1157,["with your psyche,","creating great problems for you."]],[1161,["[On the right-hand side] is the power","of action which is responsible for our"]],[1167,["mental and physical efforts, because","when we go into action, we put in effort."]],[1172,["This is the area where our future lies","[right side]"]],[1177,["and this is the area where our past lies","[left side]."]],[1180,["Past of our present life and beyond that","is the collective Subconscious"]],[1186,["which is beyond that.","Beyond this line [right side]"]],[1189,["is the Supra-conscious,","[which] is the future,"]],[1191,["and beyond that is the collective","Supra-conscious."]],[1195,["These are the areas that are within us","and the material side is below,"]],[1202,["and the hell is below that."]],[1206,["When we start getting any experience","in life –"]],[1209,["say, a person is sitting","and suddenly he starts jumping."]],[1211,["He thinks, \"I have got","Kundalini awakening.\""]],[1214,["How can that be?","If there is Kundalini awakening,"]],[1217,["you are in charge of that;","you know you are the master."]],[1222,["If you do not know what is happening","to you, it is somebody else"]],[1225,["who is doing the tricks."]],[1226,["Maybe you have moved too much","onto the left-hand side"]],[1229,["and some spirit has possessed you,","and he is making you jump."]],[1233,["That cannot be any spiritual experience;"]],[1236,["spiritual experience is only one","and when you get it,"]],[1240,["you become master of your Self.","Unless and until that happens,"]],[1246,["one should not accept anything","as a spiritual experience."]],[1249,["For example, a master, so called,","who lives in Tibet or something,"]],[1253,["who has died and who is giving","experiences."]],[1256,["All this is all absurd things."]],[1259,["You are your own master, no doubt,","but you have to be made into it."]],[1263,["Unless and until you are connected","to the mains through this,"]],[1267,["unless and until you are baptized,","you are not your Spirit."]],[1272,["You are to be actually baptized,","in the sense it’s a living process."]],[1277,["Just like a seed sprouts,","a seed’s primule comes out."]],[1282,["In the same way, this Kundalini","has to pass through all these chakras"]],[1287,["and enter through your","fontanel bone area,"]],[1290,["awakening this centre."]],[1291,["It sucks in the Ego and Superego,","which is created by these two powers here –"]],[1297,["Superego and Ego – and just creating","a portion of the head here,"]],[1302,["which is called as the","fontanel bone area, very soft,"]],[1306,["and the thing gets out."]],[1309,["You can feel the cool breeze","of the Kundalini."]],[1313,["The Spirit resides in your heart.","Nobody knows."]],[1316,["They said, \"God is in me.\"","Where is He? Where is He placed?"]],[1321,["He resides in your heart","but you are not aware of it;"]],[1328,["it is not in your conscious mind,","it is not in your central nervous system."]],[1332,["It knows about you,","but you are not conscious of it."]],[1335,["When the Kundalini passes through","these various centres"]],[1338,["and pierces through this one,","then the seat of the Spirit is here,"]],[1344,["the seat of the Spirit."]],[1346,["And that’s how, when the Kundalini","touches there, the seat is informed,"]],[1350,["like the seat of your government","is Washington:"]],[1353,["wherever may be the President,","if the information goes to Washington,"]],[1358,["he is informed, like that, this is the seat.","And when it informs, the Spirit knows"]],[1364,["about it, and then you start feeling","the cool breeze,"]],[1368,["the emitting of the cool breeze","in the hands which is called as"]],[1374,["the cool breeze of the Holy Spirit."]],[1378,["Some people asked me that,","\"Is it cool breeze or hot breeze?\""]],[1384,["You know that when there is any friction,","even in the matter, it creates heat."]],[1392,["So, it has to be cooled,","but not very cooled; it is not very cool."]],[1396,["If you become extremely cold, that also","means that your left side is all blocked."]],[1402,["If there are imbalances in you,","like you are too much emotional,"]],[1407,["then you’ll go more towards this [left]","side, and this side is very, very vulnerable."]],[1413,["And once you start going","too much on that side,"]],[1416,["there are areas built within you which","are called as Collective Subconscious."]],[1420,["The other day, as I told you,","that cancer is caused by the attack"]],[1424,["of proteins – which are called as","Protein 58 and all that,"]],[1431,["because the scientists don’t know","what they are – they come from this area."]],[1436,["They say it comes from the areas –","I mean, the doctors are honest,"]],[1440,["because whatever they know,","that’s what they say –"]],[1442,["it comes from the areas which are","built within us since our creation."]],[1449,["We call it as Collective Subconscious."]],[1451,["We know all about it because you will,","yourself, see when you get your realization,"]],[1455,["that all these things are there","and they attack."]],[1460,["This left-sided attack gives you","a thing like cancer"]],[1464,["and many other troubles like mental","problems and schizophrenia"]],[1470,["and all such things."]],[1472,["Right side movement too much, where","these are all the psyche people"]],[1477,["like Mr. Freud, who was really","half-baked and a funny person,"]],[1482,["who said that you should not allow","any conditioning upon yourself"]],[1492,["and do as you like.","He didn’t know that there is"]],[1495,["another power within us.","If you try to do as you like,"]],[1502,["then what happens?","You start living a life of an Ego,"]],[1508,["where the whole life becomes","an ego-oriented life."]],[1512,["You do not accept any conditioning,","nothing."]],[1514,["\"I’ll do as I like, I’ll live as I like;","I’m a free person.\""]],[1518,["Free doesn’t mean license,","so I have a license to do what I like –"]],[1522,["I am a free person,","I can do what I like with myself.\""]],[1525,["And then you start leading","a life of Ego."]],[1529,["If you have this left-side problem,","then the problems attack you"]],[1534,["in the sense that you feel depressed,","you feel very unhappy,"]],[1538,["you feel as if the whole world","is going to be collapsing on you,"]],[1543,["and you are extremely receded from life.","You become recluses with this left side."]],[1550,["But with the right-side,","you are riding a very fast horse,"]],[1554,["we have to say in a way that the people","who are, say, very dominating type –"]],[1562,["Hitler is the extreme of that,","you can say."]],[1565,["But now, Mr. Hitler, if you went","and told him that, \"You suffer from ego,\""]],[1569,["he would have killed you;","he can’t bear that."]],[1572,["And this kind of a thing, when it comes","in you, this ego-orientation,"]],[1576,["is more dangerous, because you harm","others and you are not aware of it."]],[1581,["So both the things are harmful to you.","You have to lead a life of a balance,"]],[1587,["in the centre."]],[1590,["This balance, if you achieve","by using these two powers,"]],[1594,["like the brake and the accelerator","within you, you develop that balance,"]],[1599,["and [when] that balance is achieved,","then you lead a very simple, balanced life."]],[1605,["But, as I said, if somebody comes and","tells you, \"You have to stand on your head,\""]],[1610,["you’ll go on standing on your head."]],[1611,["If they say, \"You must have so much","of waistline, so much of this thing,\""]],[1615,["they will be jogging throughout."]],[1617,["If anything you tell them, they will go","to such an extreme end"]],[1621,["that either they’ll jump onto","the right side or to the left side."]],[1626,["When you go to the left side,","the experience can be like you might feel"]],[1632,["that you are seeing things","from somewhere,"]],[1635,["or you might feel that you are jumping","in your bed."]],[1639,["The other day, I met a man who said","that, in his dream,"]],[1642,["he saw somebody coming and piercing","into his forehead,"]],[1646,["and since then he’s sort of immobilized."]],[1648,["All sorts of experiences you can get","if you go to the left-hand side."]],[1652,["Some of the drugs can take you","to the left and some take you to the right."]],[1657,["LSD takes you to the right,","by which you start seeing things"]],[1661,["like you see colours and things –","you go to the Supra-conscious area."]],[1666,["The Supra-conscious area is more","dangerous, in a way, to the seekers"]],[1670,["than the other side, because –","like you get Supra-conscious people"]],[1677,["who start seeing something written","on the wall,"]],[1680,["they start getting things in their hand,","they start prophesying"]],[1685,["and all sorts of things they do.","All such people think they have become God."]],[1690,["This is a very dangerous situation."]],[1692,["They always think that because","actually they are held by some busybodies"]],[1696,["who are making them evil.","These are actually the busybodies."]],[1701,["We have one very good example","of Dr Lak in England;"]],[1706,["he died, but a very ambitious man."]],[1709,["And he could not complete his thesis,","what he wanted to do about surgery."]],[1714,["So his spirit entered into a soldier","who was fighting in Vietnam,"]],[1722,["and this soldier – he didn’t enter","into his own son –"]],[1726,["he told this man that, \"You go and see","my son in England"]],[1729,["and you start a curative centre","of this late Mr. Lak\","]],[1734,["I mean, he’s dead, \"and I will help","there; you better go and see my son.\""]],[1738,["This fellow in that possessed state,","went to the son"]],[1741,["and the son said, \"Alright, how am I","to believe that you are my father,"]],[1745,["that my father is haunting you?\""]],[1747,["He said, \"I will tell you so many things","that we did together secretly.\""]],[1751,["And he was amazed. He said, \"Alright,","let’s start the thing.\""]],[1753,["And they have got this kind","of an institute where,"]],[1757,["if you are suffering from some disease","or something,"]],[1759,["you have to write to that institute."]],[1761,["What they do, they will tell you,","\"At 5 o’clock, on such and such date,\" –"]],[1766,["they are honest, I should say –","\"we’ll enter into your body and cure you.\""]],[1770,["They will cure one disease but,","because of this extreme push this side,"]],[1774,["you are again pushed back on the other","side, rebounded –"]],[1777,["and you may develop a horrible","nervous system."]],[1781,["You might become lunatic,","you might become mad."]],[1784,["People who have been his patients","are worse patients now,"]],[1788,["and I have been treating them in India,","many of them."]],[1791,["So, such organizations exist","and they start telling you"]],[1795,["about many things like, \"Oh, if you","go this side, this will happen.\""]],[1800,["I mean, it’s a very subtle behaviour","of these horrible people,"]],[1805,["these busybodies,","and they really try to spoil you."]],[1810,["Now, many of the gurus who come here –","these so-called gurus –"]],[1815,["either work on this side or that side,","or sometimes both sides."]],[1819,["They use the spirits to mesmerize you,","first of all."]],[1826,["They will use any spirit to introduce","in this centre, for example –"]],[1829,["an Antichrist will touch this one."]],[1833,["And I know of somebody who is here –","an absolute Antichrist;"]],[1838,["he touches this centre,","and creates problems in you"]],[1841,["and produces within you a symptom","just like blood cancer."]],[1847,["There’s another one who wants","to teach you how to fly –"]],[1850,["he gives you epilepsy,","simple thing like epilepsy."]],[1855,["There is another one who gives","you cancer; there’s a third one"]],[1858,["who gives you a heart attack –","they are experts on giving you diseases;"]],[1863,["all one better than the other","and in the long run,"]],[1866,["you find all your money is lost,","you are lost,"]],[1870,["there’s nothing left with you","[and] you are a recluse."]],[1872,["There’s somebody who has made","his disciples so funny"]],[1876,["that they are even afraid","of the vegetable, like a garlic –"]],[1880,["you show them the garlic,","they’ll run away."]],[1882,["If you show them a lemon,","they’ll run away."]],[1885,["These people have worked on you","because you are naïve."]],[1889,["First of all, you have money."]],[1890,["They have no interest in the poor people","of India."]],[1893,["They have no interest in looking","after people who understand them."]],[1898,["They have only interest in you","who are naïve, who are simple people,"]],[1902,["who have money and, best of all,","you are that category which is the seekers."]],[1910,["You are born specially to seek your Self;","you are a special category."]],[1915,["Everybody’s not like that.","In this place, New York,"]],[1921,["there may be many seekers, I agree.","But this category is not with everyone."]],[1928,["There are few human beings,","relatively to its population,"]],[1933,["who are really seekers, and these","special categories have to become prophets"]],[1938,["and they have to make others prophets."]],[1940,["It was prophesied by a great poet","like William Blake."]],[1944,["We should read all these things","and understand that,"]],[1948,["even Sahaja Yoga, has been prophesied","in the Bible."]],[1951,["In all the Puranas, in all the books,","it is prophesied that,"]],[1954,["in these modern times,","this is going to happen:"]],[1957,["that thousands of people, who have been","searching God in their previous lives,"]],[1961,["are going to receive their blessings","and they are going to become that."]],[1965,["Under these promises you start","going to these people,"]],[1968,["but they cannot cure you","because they are not authorized."]],[1971,["They are not here to give you","realization."]],[1973,["They are here to make their money.","They are parasites,"]],[1978,["they’re absolute parasites."]],[1979,["Say, now today as he said,","my husband is well placed,"]],[1982,["maybe he might come from a rich family","or whatever it is."]],[1985,["I don’t have to depend on you","or anyone."]],[1987,["But, supposing I was like Christ,","a carpenter’s daughter."]],[1996,["So, I would have lived like that;","it makes no difference"]],[1999,["whether you are rich or poor."]],[2002,["To me, comfort has no meaning:","I can sleep here, I can sleep anywhere."]],[2008,["Yesterday, we went to Boston","and it was a small little room"]],[2010,["of a student… we were six, seven people,","we all slept together; no problem for us."]],[2015,["In my house, I have bedrooms,","I have everything –"]],[2018,["too much of a comfort –","and it falls upon me; I don’t like it."]],[2022,["A person who is a holy person","doesn’t seek others’ money"]],[2026,["and doesn’t live like a parasite."]],[2028,["For example, you see yourself,","if I tell you, \"I give you money"]],[2030,["for your living,\" will you accept,","anyone of you?"]],[2033,["And these people are doing nothing","for their living;"]],[2035,["they are living on your money,","they are having Rolls Royces"]],[2038,["and this and that.","A saint has no interest in these points."]],[2045,["Like, one of them who is nowadays here,","who has now become a Yankee, they say,"]],[2049,["he told to English people, he wrote to","them that, \"If you want me to come there\" –"]],[2056,["they’re all mad after him!","They said they have got knowledge."]],[2059,["What sort of a knowledge,","one only knows."]],[2062,["That, \"If I am coming to England,","you have to give me a Rolls Royce.\""]],[2065,["The poor boys, in England –","as it is, people are not so rich."]],[2069,["Young people don’t have so much money –","and they starved themselves,"]],[2072,["ate potatoes, did this and that,","and they created a fifty-ninth Rolls Royce –"]],[2078,["I mean, he has already fifty-eight –","this fifty-ninth was created"]],[2081,["and this fellow very nicely came","to receive the Rolls Royce."]],[2084,["You ask them,","\"What has he given you?\""]],[2086,["\"He has given us knowledge,","we are in knowledge.\""]],[2088,["They look just like possessed people","they are moving"]],[2092,["and they are going down."]],[2093,["Those people who come from that area","have mostly blood cancer."]],[2100,["And they just live","as if they are not living."]],[2105,["It’s such a horrible thing.","What knowledge have they got?"]],[2108,["If you have knowledge, you should know","what’s happening in another person,"]],[2111,["you should get collectively conscious,","you should become,"]],[2114,["it’s actualization","and it should happen to you."]],[2117,["You should feel that,","as you have shown here,"]],[2119,["that all these centres","you can feel on your fingers."]],[2124,["You should feel your own centres","and you should feel the centres of others."]],[2128,["You should become that."]],[2130,["If you are satisfied with what you have","done, and what wrongs you have done,"]],[2134,["we cannot cure you.","You have to know that you have not found it"]],[2137,["and you have to get to it,","in all honesty and sincerity."]],[2142,["And throw away all that is nonsensical."]],[2144,["Then only it works out and this has","to happen to you,"]],[2147,["that you start feeling","all these centres here."]],[2150,["Now see, you can see the colours","that are given separately onto this."]],[2153,["Now, for example,","this is the left hand"]],[2155,["and left hand means","the left side of this one."]],[2159,["Now this one, if it is catching –","if you feel heat, if you feel any catching,"]],[2165,["if you feel that there’s burning","in this finger, in this thumb of left hand –"]],[2169,["this is all left side, is the psyche;","means somebody has tried"]],[2173,["to disturb your psyche","in an unauthorized way."]],[2177,["Most of the gurus have this."]],[2181,["All the left side can be caught up","by them, but specially this one is the sign"]],[2185,["that you have been to somebody","who has been unauthorized, anyone."]],[2190,["You can go to a spiritualist,","is a most dangerous game"]],[2194,["to have a spiritualist."]],[2195,["I was surprised, somebody told me,","\"Mother, You are going to America."]],[2197,["Now they have started witchcraft also.","[UNCLEAR]. It’s magic.\""]],[2204,["They told me, \"It’s much worse now.","It was better ten years back;"]],[2207,["now it’s witchcraft. You’ll be facing","people who have been doing witchcraft,"]],[2210,["they are doing all openly.\"","And they warned me that,"]],[2218,["\"Maybe you may not be able to do","anything there\", but I don’t think so;"]],[2223,["it’s much better than I expected","and I’m very happy about it."]],[2226,["So, this is what happens to you, is that,","when you start doing something like that,"]],[2231,["you start showing here."]],[2233,["Now, this one is this side,","left side of this very important centre."]],[2241,["This one shows that you are guilty,","you feel guilty; you are diffident."]],[2247,["When the Spirit approaches this point,","it makes you all the time feel guilty;"]],[2252,["you feel guilty for everything.","What is there to feel guilty?"]],[2255,["I mean, you have not murdered anyone;","real murderer will never feel guilty,"]],[2260,["but the one who has done nothing","all the time starts saying,"]],[2262,["\"Oh, I should not have said this,","I should not have done this,"]],[2265,["I should not have gone there.\""]],[2267,["All these feelings come to you","from Left Vishuddhi."]],[2272,["It can be from the kind of training","you have had."]],[2275,["For example, mostly I have seen","Catholics because they have to go"]],[2278,["and confess. Even if they have done","no sins, they have to go and confess"]],[2282,["because the priest must have his","existence, somehow."]],[2286,["This kind of a thing, if you have that,","you have to go and confess"]],[2290,["some sort of a sin.","You may even coin [some] of your own,"]],[2292,["because you don’t know what to talk","to him if you have not committed any sins."]],[2296,["So all these things are settled down.","You must know, all the sins"]],[2301,["and all the blasphemy, everything that","you have done is going to be forgiven,"]],[2305,["has to be forgiven."]],[2307,["If it is going to be","en-masse realization,"]],[2310,["all these things have to be forgiven.","It’s written;"]],[2314,["I was reading the other day","Pilgrim’s Progress"]],[2316,["and he has said that all these things","will be forgiven. Is promised."]],[2323,["And what sin can you commit?","What guilt can you have?"]],[2327,["If God is ocean of forgiveness and love,","what can you do?"]],[2332,["He is going to cleanse you.","He is going to bless you. He has to do."]],[2336,["So what’s the use of feeling guilty","all the time?"]],[2339,["But that doesn’t mean you should feel","arrogant on the other side."]],[2342,["This side you’ll feel guilty","and the right side,"]],[2344,["if you have a catch on the right side,","that means you have been very aggressive."]],[2351,["Or you may be suffering from","[UNCLEAR cold] or all these things;"]],[2353,["these are suggestive of physical side.","The right side is for physical and mental side."]],[2359,["All these things you can verify gradually."]],[2361,["I would suggest that you should get your","realization first; first thing first."]],[2365,["Let’s open your eyes; let’s you have","the light within yourself"]],[2368,["and see for yourself how it works,","alright? Should we have that?"]],[2374,["And also we’ll have some questions."]],[2377,["They’re already feeling it.","You are feeling guilty now."]],[2396,["Yes, that’s true,","you are already feeling it."]],[2402,["This is a very common disease","in the West, to feel guilty,"]],[2405,["it’s a very common disease.","We Indians never feel guilty, you know?"]],[2413,["They have other things but not this,","thank God."]],[2418,["They have many other problems,","terrible ones, unbelievable…"]],[2433,["As I was telling you, we don’t know","how to advertise;"]],[2448,["we’ve done our level best","but people don’t come to reality."]],[2452,["You have one mesmerizer here.","All of them stayed for this [UNCLEAR]."]],[2459,["We tried everything, I don’t know","how to reach to the seekers;"]],[2462,["I don’t know what they are seeking."]],[2464,["They want all the circus –","I don’t know what they want. Hmm."]],[2471,["So, any questions?"]],[2482,["Yesterday I told you about Christ,","isn’t it? When He is awakened,"]],[2487,["I told you that.","You were there for the lecture?"]],[2490,["When He’s awakened here, that the Ego","and Superego are sucked in."]],[2496,["That is what is promised,","that He is the one who sucks"]],[2499,["Ego and Superego,","but He’s to be awakened."]],[2511,["First thing that happens,","when Kundalini rises,"]],[2513,["that you find there is no thought","in your mind."]],[2517,["There’s no thought,","you have become blank, first thing."]],[2520,["Then when it pierces through,","you start feeling the cool breeze."]],[2525,["It’s so simple, he can’t believe it.","You don’t know,"]],[2531,["there was a gentleman who came to me,","he’s an actor in London."]],[2535,["He came in a program,","and when he got it, he laughed"]],[2537,["and he couldn’t bear it. He said,","\"Mother, I will go out and laugh now,"]],[2540,["aloud.\" He went around and laughed."]],[2542,["I said, \"But why did you laugh so much?\""]],[2544,["He said, \"I did all kinds of acrobats.","That’s why I was laughing."]],[2547,["It’s so simple.\" Imagine. People have","written books after books"]],[2553,["and so much of nonsense they have done,","I tell you. You can’t imagine. All trash."]],[2561,["Are you alright now, better?"]],[2567,["Now you go on saying,","\"I’m not guilty\" in your heart."]],[2570,["Put your right hand on your heart.","Yes, now… again, say it thrice."]],[2586,["alright? We’ll work it out, but you just","say, \"I’m not guilty.\""]],[2596,["You have put your own load here.","Better now, see. Remove it."]],[2601,["Ah, I’m not guilty.","In my heart, I try and it hurts,"]],[2608,["but I feel a heat here."]],[2611,["It is little there, but it’s better now,","gradually."]],[2613,["How many years you have been","feeling guilty?"]],[2618,["About a year."]],[2620,["It will work out."]],[2623,["You say, the realization –","is it a connection that you want us"]],[2629,["to achieve or to understand,","between the Spiritual…"]],[2632,["in other words, the connection","of the Spirit?"]],[2634,["Of course, of course,","it’s the breaking through; you become that."]],[2638,["It’s the connection you have established.","Like, every instrument has a connecting line,"]],[2643,["isn’t it? You have to connect it","to the mains –"]],[2644,["you are just to be connected","to the mains."]],[2646,["That is fantastic. For example,","you have a camera or say,"]],[2651,["you have a television","or something like that."]],[2654,["If you connect it to the mains,","it starts showing its fantastic things."]],[2658,["You are like that. Nothing so fantastic.","You are fantastic,"]],[2662,["but you have no self-esteem."]],[2665,["I don’t understand, human beings","have no self-esteem."]],[2668,["I mean, they are top of all the evolution,","they are higher than all the animals."]],[2672,["Now they are learning the behaviour","from animals."]],[2675,["We have nothing to learn from them.","Have we to learn anything from them?"]],[2679,["God has placed us so much above."]],[2681,["Yes, my child?"]],[2682,["Why are we separated from the Spirit","and are we at birth?"]],[2688,["We are separated because of ignorance.","We started becoming from amoebic stage"]],[2694,["to human stage, developing our","awareness better and better and better."]],[2699,["Like a reflector we are,","so the reflector is improving gradually"]],[2704,["and the reflection of that spiritual life","shows better and better"]],[2708,["till we reach a human stage."]],[2710,["Now, here we come at this stage","in the process, of the living process,"]],[2714,["and then we become connected,","and that ignorance is finished."]],[2720,["We are not separated as such,","we are looked after."]],[2723,["Like, there is darkness in this room,","but you are not separated from light."]],[2728,["Only you have to switch on."]],[2734,["There is no punishment or anything","done to you, no,"]],[2738,["because you have come from that.","Your awareness has started improving."]],[2744,["You keep talking about the living process.","This can happen while you’re alive,"]],[2750,["it doesn’t happen when you die?"]],[2754,["No, not. You have to live,","you have to have a body;"]],[2758,["if you don’t have a body,","this realization doesn’t take place."]],[2760,["So some people talk of the dead gurus","and all that, it’s not possible."]],[2765,["You have to get it when you are living;","you have to have the body."]],[2768,["Body is the temple as you can say,","that if there is no bulb,"]],[2773,["you cannot get light.","There may be light"]],[2775,["but you have to have a bulb."]],[2777,["It has to come in the form","of a human being, not in the animals."]],[2785,["You mentioned here that you are","the link of Self realization."]],[2793,["So are we, or the people who get","Self-realization here,"]],[2799,["getting their Self-realization","through you or…"]],[2803,["No, no, no – your Self.","Did they say I am the link?"]],[2806,["He should not have said that."]],[2809,["It means that I am the one who enlightens,","that’s all. I am, as one light…"]],[2816,["you can enlighten also."]],[2818,["It should not have said that,","it’s dangerous to say such a thing."]],[2822,["because if it says, everybody’s ego","comes up like that, \"Oh, what she is,"]],[2825,["who is she?\" You see everywhere,","mostly I have seen in Europe, specially,"]],[2830,["they said, \"Why you?\" I said,","\"You do it; I’ll be very happy."]],[2834,["I am a happily married woman."]],[2836,["I have a very good husband,","my children and grandchildren."]],[2840,["I have to do it, day in and day out."]],[2844,["If you can do it, nothing like it.","I will retire.\""]],[2847,["If you can do it, nothing like it.","To travel like this, work it out,"]],[2852,["spend your own money, do it."]],[2854,["It’s not [UNCLEAR] I must be","something special, no doubt,"]],[2859,["but that you find out later on,","not just now."]],[2862,["I have to be something special to do it,","but that you’ll find out later on."]],[2867,["You should not have put it in there,","because half of the Americans"]],[2870,["would not come if they say there is","somebody who is a link,"]],[2873,["because they all think they are","already realized souls,"]],[2875,["great people dropping from Heaven."]],[2877,["This is also another kind of a selfesteem."]],[2882,["Well, do you just have to want it or…","how do you get it?"]],[2889,["I think we’ll discover it later on,","because I never got it;"]],[2892,["I had it, that’s the problem."]],[2894,["No, she’s asking, does she just","have to want it, herself?"]],[2898,["Does one have to want it or does one","just all of a sudden… be it?"]],[2901,["There is one thing that","it cannot be forced."]],[2905,["Your freedom is respected.","Now you are free."]],[2909,["If the egg wants to be bird or not,","you don’t ask the egg; you don’t ask,"]],[2914,["because it’s the animal stage.","But in human stage, you have to ask for it."]],[2920,["If you do not ask, you do not get it."]],[2922,["Nobody’s going to force on you."]],[2924,["Neither the Divine is going to fall","at your feet that you ask, no."]],[2928,["On the contrary, you have to humble down","to ask for it."]],[2932,["It cannot go to arrogant people."]],[2935,["You have to ask for it, in a way.","If it works, thank your stars."]],[2940,["If it doesn’t work,","we’ll work it out later on,"]],[2944,["but you have to ask for it, no doubt.","It’s such a great thing."]],[2947,["Only that much you have to do,","not pay for it but ask for it,"]],[2954,["in a humble way."]],[2956,["Yes?"]],[2956,["Something disturbs me about the movement –","not yours, I’m just saying that"]],[2960,["you mentioned before that there are so","many seekers in the United States"]],[2964,["and [UNCLEAR elsewhere]. I find it very","disturbing to find these people"]],[2968,["are seeking divinity or spirituality,","and yet they themselves are not"]],[2973,["in a state of purification","or do not live in a pure state."]],[2979,["I don’t see how the two can reconcile","each other. I mean, I think"]],[2982,["before you realize this realization,","this connection…"]],[2985,["You must go into a cleaning process,","you mean?"]],[2988,["Yes, exactly, and really to have these","desires that are vulgar and so forth,"]],[2994,["fall away from you… and yet they…"]],[2996,["No, this was done before,","and it’s a very slow process"]],[3000,["which was worked out,","that you try to cleanse yourself,"]],[3003,["but it’s not possible unless and until","there’s a realized guru"]],[3007,["who looks after you, each individual,","and all that."]],[3010,["Now, the Grace has decided that,","first of all,"]],[3014,["let us start all the machinery,","all the cars you can say,"]],[3018,["second-hand, third-hand, fifth-hand."]],[3021,["Let us start; see how far they can go,","then try to correct."]],[3028,["Unless and until you get out of your car,","also you do not know what’s wrong with it."]],[3032,["So, unless and until you get","your realization, really you cannot know."]],[3037,["For example now, I’m an old,","ancient guru of olden times, take it like that."]],[3042,["Now, you come to me.","First of all, these gurus used to test you."]],[3047,["They would break you, stand on your head,","sit on your legs and do all kinds of things,"]],[3051,["because they would take only one person,","one person among millions,"]],[3058,["and see that if they could work it out."]],[3059,["And they would really work on him","and make him do all those things."]],[3066,["The trouble is, in modern times,","if you tell anybody to do something,"]],[3071,["they’ll do just the opposite.","It’s a very difficult situation."]],[3075,["Now think for a moment this point of view:"]],[3078,["I want you to have your realization","because I can’t enjoy it myself."]],[3081,["You have to have your realization."]],[3082,["I can see that diamond in you;","I want you to have it."]],[3085,["So what would Mother do?"]],[3087,["If she has to do something,","she’ll go round and say,"]],[3090,["\"Alright, let’s have it.\""]],[3091,["First you have it and see if you like it or not."]],[3094,["Supposing I have cooked the food","and you say, \"No, I don’t want to have it.\""]],[3097,["What will I do? \"Alright, taste a little bit,","see how it is.\""]],[3102,["Once you jump into it, for these people","have got it."]],[3104,["Now he’s got realization,","he knows the taste of it."]],[3108,["Not only that, but without realization,","you can’t judge yourself."]],[3112,["If I judge you, I say now,","supposing I say, \"Warren,"]],[3115,["you have lots of ego.\" When he came","to me, he was ego like a balloon,"]],[3119,["like this, you won’t believe.","But if I tell him that,"]],[3122,["he would have punched me immediately,","isn’t it? Now you agree then?"]],[3128,["But this fellow, I didn’t say to him,","\"You have ego,\" or anything."]],[3131,["\"Alright,\" I said, \"We give him realization,\"","then he came down on it."]],[3135,["Then I put him into proper state,","raised his Kundalini."]],[3139,["Then he started seeing his ego. He said,","\"Oh, God, such an ego I have, Mother."]],[3144,["Now what to do with it?\"","I said, \"I’ll tell you how to reduce it.\""]],[3147,["So, unless and until you have the eyes,","you can’t see, and if you tell them,"]],[3151,["\"Don’t do it,\" he will do it.","Best thing is to give the eyes first to you."]],[3156,["You may not see it so clearly","but you’ll start seeing it."]],[3159,["Then you’ll start improving yourself.","You’ll judge yourself."]],[3162,["You better judge yourself.","It’s much better than I judge you."]],[3166,["Then you correct yourself","because you can’t just bear it."]],[3168,["Yesterday there was a lady,","she was suffering from liver –"]],[3171,["she has not come today – and she told me,","\"Mother, after realization I got a headache.\""]],[3175,["I said, \"You have a liver?","Otherwise you would not attend to it,"]],[3179,["but now you have got a headache,","you’d better attend to it.\""]],[3181,["So I told her how to look after it;","within two days, she’s alright, she’s cured."]],[3187,["People become mad and they don’t know","they are possessed,"]],[3191,["till they absolutely land up","in the lunatic asylum."]],[3195,["To give them judgment power","is very important."]],[3201,["And how will you make out when he’s","a real guru or not a real guru?"]],[3204,["Even logically you can, but otherwise,","how will you make out? Very simple."]],[3208,["You just seek [UNCLEAR the light]."]],[3212,["So, you must get your discrimination","power, but actually while getting it,"]],[3218,["you really become the master.","That’s the simple thing."]],[3222,["Now, he has been with me only","for eighteen weeks or maybe eighteen months?"]],[3226,["Eighteen months only;","now he is a master."]],[3228,["He has established seven centres","in seven cities in Australia"]],[3232,["and he’s come to America, I mean,","imported him for you people."]],[3236,["But now, you’d better go","and look after other people."]],[3242,["What’s the question?"]],[3244,["You were talking about the Spirit","being in the Heart chakra there,"]],[3247,["over on the left side. I’d like to know","why it’s on the left instead of in the middle,"]],[3253,["because if the Spirit – it has to do","with realization –"]],[3256,["why isn’t it in the middle in the central","Kundalini, instead of on the other side"]],[3260,["like that, and why is it…","and why in…the heart, yeah."]],[3264,["The heart. Heart is the main thing","within us, that’s the last."]],[3269,["Once heart stops, we don’t exist:","sheer existence."]],[3274,["That’s the most important organ","that God has given us."]],[3279,["Once the Spirit is angry, in any way","strained, any way despaired,"]],[3287,["we just exist, and then we die.","There’s nothing left."]],[3291,["Heart is very important. That’s why","He’s placed there, in human beings,"]],[3296,["but it comes out, comes out also."]],[3299,["It can come out and see,","go around and see. But the seat is there."]],[3305,["When you will start growing","into Sahaja Yoga,"]],[3308,["you will start seeing how this Spirit","manifests and how it grows."]],[3313,["It sits on the seat also."]],[3316,["What does it look like?"]],[3317,["It is now in the heart,","but then it comes on the seat,"]],[3322,["at a point, that’s much different,","that’s much later."]],[3324,["I see."]],[3325,["Alright? So it has to be brought there;","first a seat has to be created properly."]],[3330,["Just now, heart is the one,","[UNCLEAR it lies just there],"]],[3334,["it doesn’t… it is not according to our will,","it is His will that is important."]],[3341,["We have to please His whims also."]],[3346,["Would You say conscience and soul is …","resides in the heart area?"]],[3350,["What is it?"]],[3351,["Conscience; in other words, people –","their guilt feelings"]],[3354,["or their realization of what’s right","and wrong – resides in the heart feeling,"]],[3358,["it comes from the heart area?","This knowledge…?"]],[3360,["It’s not that, it doesn’t come;","it comes from the Left side, as I showed you."]],[3363,["But heart area is the one","where resides the Spirit, actually."]],[3368,["So the soul would be…?"]],[3369,["Soul… and the soul is a wider thing","than Spirit is."]],[3376,["Because when one dies, only the element,","that is the Earth element, dies"]],[3385,["and the water element also","starts oozing out."]],[3390,["But whatever remains are the three","elements, which are the three auras,"]],[3395,["plus the Spirit is the source."]],[3398,["And the Kundalini also resides on that."]],[3400,["After realization, you can see that,","you can see so many Kundalinis floating –"]],[3407,["they have all seen it.","You’ll see it, it’s fantastic."]],[3411,["You are all fantastic people."]],[3413,["That’s not the aura necessarily?"]],[3415,["No, no, no, no, no – auras are right side;","Supra-conscious."]],[3418,["But you actually see these Kundalinis","floating around – I’ll show you."]],[3430,["So what do you say, now?"]],[3432,["How do we do this for ourselves?","How do we do this for our Self?"]],[3437,["Now, that’s the point; we are coming","to that point now."]],[3444,["We should not have put ‘missing link’","on the poster]."]],[3455,["Did you put ‘missing link’ or what?"]],[3457,["No, no, no…"]],[3457,["No, no, no, no, no – don’t say all that."]],[3460,["Not the missing link."]],[3460,["A bit too much."]],[3464,["If it offends you, get your realization first…"]],[3468,["Not offends, but it offends everyone","because we should learn"]],[3478,["from our experiences; Christ said nothing","except that He said, \"I am the Son of God,\""]],[3485,["and they crucified Him.","One has to be careful."]],[3491,["If you say anything like that,","people don’t like it. Better not say."]],[3495,["Tell them I am just like you, blind –","little of my eyes are open,"]],[3502,["then they’ll be happy.","It was very wrong to say that."]],[3505,["I didn’t see that, I would have told them.","I am anxious not to say."]],[3512,["It seems to imply that we’re getting","your realization,"]],[3516,["the realization through you–","that you are the link to the Eternal."]],[3522,["But why will you have objection to that?"]],[3525,["I beg your pardon?","Will you have objection if it is so?"]],[3528,["Well, it would be your realization","that we are tasting,"]],[3535,["because you would be the link if…"]],[3537,["But supposing I am the link.","Supposing I am the link, supposing."]],[3542,["Take a supposition – then what’s happening?","What is the harm?"]],[3547,["What do you mean, \"No harm\"?","But there’s a price for everything."]],[3550,["No, no – should not; because you must","know that unconscious can’t talk to you."]],[3555,["Somebody has to come and talk to you,","somebody has to decode,"]],[3559,["somebody had to tell you."]],[3561,["It’s not easy to become human being.","You know it’s very difficult"]],[3564,["for the Divine to become this.","Absolutely, it’s such a hazardous thing"]],[3569,["to become a human being,","because they are so absurd, so stupid,"]],[3573,["and you don’t know what to do with them.","It’s a very difficult task."]],[3580,["I’m shocked sometimes – how can they","do it? I mean, I just can’t understand."]],[3585,["What’s that, that end part of it?"]],[3587,["For the Divine to become a human being,","she’s saying; for the Divine to become…"]],[3591,["Is a very difficult thing.","Divine to be Divine is the easiest thing,"]],[3596,["but to become a human being,","to talk to them, to look after them…"]],[3602,["Supposing if I am Divine.","If you insult me, you’ll be hurt"]],[3607,["and that I wouldn’t like","because I am compassion."]],[3611,["Like Christ said, \"Forgive them,","for they do not know what they are doing.\""]],[3615,["For the Jews He said so, for the Jews.","\"For they do not know what they are doing,\""]],[3621,["because He was frightened.","They are crucifying Him"]],[3623,["and He was frightened for the people","because He was compassion."]],[3626,["So, it’s a very difficult situation,","very sensitive."]],[3632,["But you should not have put that,","I tell you, it was a mistake."]],[3636,["I never saw that.","It’s a good pointing out."]],[3639,["I know it, people won’t like it.","They won’t like it."]],[3644,["I think our second one is a better one.","Who did that?"]],[3649,["It was done for the Australian tour,","Mother."]],[3651,["Ah, Australians are very different","from Americans."]],[3657,["You should never have done for Americans –","no, no, no, no."]],[3660,["Australians are very different people,","because they were punished"]],[3663,["once upon a time, their forefathers.","So they do not have ego trips much,"]],[3668,["they do not have. They want a redeemer,","they are a very different type of people."]],[3677,["Americans think they are the redeemers","of the whole world."]],[3679,["They are responsible for everything."]],[3681,["This is a very different land;","you should have never done that."]],[3686,["Yes, it’s a very common thing.","Americans really think"]],[3690,["they are going to redeem the whole world."]],[3692,["And all the Antichrists are coming","and settling down with them."]],[3696,["All the Antichrists are, as a result,","and it’s such a dangerous situation"]],[3701,["that I just pray that they would have","more sense to understand"]],[3704,["these are Antichrists – throw them away!"]],[3706,["Could You explain what You mean by","the manifestation;"]],[3710,["how do you see an Antichrist?","What does he manifest as?"]],[3713,["He’s a devil, he’s a Satan."]],[3716,["You know why … I’m very, I mean,","as a person it wouldn’t affect me,"]],[3721,["it wouldn’t bother me. If I see something","as, what you call evil,"]],[3725,["I don’t consider things being evil","per se but …"]],[3728,["For this I would just say you get","your realization,"]],[3730,["then you will know how much it bothers","you, because you don’t see, that’s the thing."]],[3733,["If you don’t see a snake, how will you know","how it attacks you?"]],[3735,["Yeah, I know but I mean, as a person that","doesn’t like whatever is unrealized?"]],[3740,["and stuff – you reject it.","Why is it so effective as a …"]],[3747,["harmful adversary …"]],[3747,["Because it kills all your chances","of realization, first and foremost."]],[3756,["I don’t mind if they are thugs,","they take away money from you,"]],[3759,["make you poor, do what they like;","I don’t mind all that."]],[3762,["Let them be parasites, do anything;","there are so many people like that, isn’t it?"]],[3766,["There are so many beggars,","there are so many thieves"]],[3773,["and there are murderers, every sort.","I don’t mind anything of that kind."]],[3776,["But because they spoil your Kundalini,","that’s why I have all the objection."]],[3781,["You have to have your realization,","that’s your right."]],[3783,["And then do you shrug it off, I mean,","does it affect you if you are …"]],[3786,["if you have…"]],[3787,["No, no, not like that – that’s not true."]],[3790,["No, you shrug off – she’s asking do you","shrug off your … all the negativity?"]],[3795,["Yeah, the negativity,","that’s what I mean."]],[3797,["Who shrugs?"]],[3797,["She’s asking does one, when they get","their realization, shrug off the negativity?"]],[3803,["After realization? Oh, they just run away."]],[3805,["So I’m saying that, when you see this,","you just … that’s why I …"]],[3809,["I mean people… even before they have","realization …"]],[3810,["That a person who is not a realized soul,","according to me, is not yet really a person."]],[3818,["That’s what I’m trying to tell you,","that you are not yet fully that."]],[3821,["You have to become that.","Now the gentleman is getting very, very …"]],[3825,["Impatient?"]],[3826,["And that should be so because – now,","let us not too much go into mental activity"]],[3832,["because what will happen, you may not","get your realization"]],[3834,["because of mental activities","and this centre goes out a little bit."]],[3837,["So, let us stop at this point.","Let’s have it now."]],[3841,["You have to take out your shoes.","I’m sorry, because that helps"]],[3844,["the Mother Earth to take away","all our problems."]],[3846,["We must get our realization at any cost;","that’s the main thing."]],[3849,["My only thing is that you must get","your realization. What’s that?"]],[3856,["Just a tape recorder."]],[3857,["He’s taping it? Could be dangerous."]],[3867,["We don’t allow them to tape;","it was the taping that started a lot of"]],[3871,["organizations this time."]],[3877,["Would you mind if it …"]],[3880,["No, it’s turned off. OK."]],[3882,["Alright? If you want to have tapes,","you can have from these people;"]],[3887,["they have got some tapes of my speeches,","but normally we don’t allow people to tape."]],[3892,["Because last time, this experience was","so horrifying that this time we have"]],[3896,["decided not to allow people who are","not Sahaja yogis to tape."]],[3899,["But if you want to have tapes,","you can have from these people."]],[3904,["Now, it’s all on the left hand,","it’s working out, it’s alright."]],[3910,["Now, let’s have your hands towards me","and close your eyes."]],[3924,["Put both the feet on the ground."]],[3931,["Both the hands towards me","and close your eyes; don’t open your eyes,"]],[3941,["because when the Kundalini rushes","through this centre of Agnya,"]],[3947,["then there is dilation of the pupils","and, if you keep your eyes open,"]],[3952,["it won’t come up. Close your eyes."]],[3956,["This happening takes place","and your attention is drawn inside."]],[4101,["Put your right hand on your heart.","Close your eyes."]],[4110,["Ask a question to me,","\"Mother, am I the Spirit?\""]],[4116,["Mother, am I the Spirit?"]],[4120,["Three times."]],[4121,["Mother, am I the Spirit?"]],[4124,["Again."]],[4125,["Mother, am I the Spirit?"]],[4134,["Now say, \"Mother, I am not guilty.\""]],[4137,["(Seekers repeat three times)"]],[4150,["Now, you have to ask for realization.","Say, \"Mother, please give me my realization.\""]],[4158,["(Seekers repeat three times)"]],[4243,["(Still a little bit left.)"]],[4274,["Now please say,","\"Mother, I forgive everyone.\""]],[4276,["Got it? Good."]],[4280,["(Seekers repeat three times)"]],[4289,["Now you have to say,","\"Mother, if I have neglected my Spirit,"]],[4296,["please forgive me.\""]],[4302,["(Seekers repeat three times)"]],[4315,["Alright?&nbsp;&nbsp;"]],[4323,["That’s it, it will work out.","Keep your eyes shut."]],[4345,["The Sahaja yogis can see now. Got it?"]],[4349,["Just put your right hand …","yes, he has Mother."]],[4351,["Just put your right hand above your head."]],[4354,["You got it. You can feel it on your head","if you have got it."]],[4359,["All the Sahaja yogis can come and see."]],[4360,["Feel ok? It’s coming out of the top","of your head? You feeling it there?"]],[4373,["Those who have been to other gurus","should say, \"Mother, I am my own guru.\""]],[4376,["I can feel his, the same – he’s got it,","he’s got it."]],[4380,["Yes, yes you can feel. He’s got it,","she knows."]],[4381,["I don’t even have to feel it …"]],[4382,["Are you feeling it on your hands?"]],[4383,["It’s coming all out of you."]],[4386,["(laughing) Yes, Yes, he’s got it, yes.","Have you got it?"]],[4402,["You didn’t say anything.","You were keeping quiet."]],[4405,["You should have said it.","You are catching on the Vishuddhi,"]],[4407,["and if you had said it,","it would have opened up. Alright,"]],[4411,["we’ll work it out. You should get it.","We can work it out."]],[4422,["Now are you feeling it? Slowly, slowly,","it’s a very subtle thing."]],[4429,["But in the second sitting it is better,","isn’t it? It’s more clear. It’s very clear."]],[4434,["Oh, it’s hot, alright.","You’re alright now, are you?"]],[4439,["It’s a pity they can’t turn the air","conditioning – the air conditioning’s"]],[4443,["causing a lot of disturbance."]],[4444,["No, no, no – it’s alright.","You believe it, it is there."]],[4447,["yesterday, somebody who got it","thought that the window was open,"]],[4454,["and then he went into the cellar to see,","and still it was there."]],[4459,["Are you alright now? Good! I’m very happy","the second sitting you got it. It’s good."]],[4468,["So changed, so changed.","Look at this gentleman."]],[4469,["Are you alright now? See, you have got it;","second sitting, you have got it."]],[4473,["Now, what about this gentleman –","you got it?"]],[4481,["Did you feel, my child? No?","Alright, I’ll work it out."]],[4486,["She’s feeling it in her left,","but not in her right. She thinks too much."]],[4492,["Agnya was, too … that’s why I said","we stop it there!"]],[4494,["That should work it out. Here,","keep your eyes shut."]],[4497,["Now, you have to forgive;","go on forgiving – \"I forgive\", say."]],[4500,["How easy is that?"]],[4501,["I forgive"]],[4502,["Again"]],[4503,["(seeker repeats twice)"]],[4505,["I forgive everyone.","(seeker repeats, Shri Mataji is working on her –"]],[4519,["Forgive, forgive, forgive.)"]],[4520,["Ah, forgiving’s not there – now forgive."]],[4529,["(Shri Mataji and the yogis continue","to work on all the seekers)"]]]);
